_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"8eDkw7CE0NKqMknPIu26fw","review_id":"4MU6iV8snDpYR6bqxgP68w","date":"2019-02-27T21:54:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9398850202560425,"text_excerpt":"Great, local breakfast option if you're in the vicinity of New Orleans' Convention Center! The establishment is located on the first floor of an office building, which could be a sort of charmless location, but they've done a great job with the interior decor and it has a warm, relaxed, earthy vibe. I had the Traditional Benedict, and it was really good. I appreciated that you could select from a couple of breakfast side options (I had the fruit cup, but there were also grits and roasted potatoes). I very much appreciated that the fruit cup was entirely good, tasty fruit (mostly bananas and strawberries, if memory serves) - there wasn't any melon or cantaloupe in it as a cheap, filler fru..."},{"business_id":"8eDkw7CE0NKqMknPIu26fw","review_id":"irY-tQmbgBJKOhQNGI_LkA","date":"2018-03-20T15:15:04","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9377684593200684,"text_excerpt":"Found this place while on our never-ending quest for breakfast spots. I did not realize that it would be so busy, but there was a fairly long line. The restaurant is on the small side, but they have utilized the space well. Once seated, service was friendly but on the slow side. Today, we both tried omlets, but the French Toast and the shrimp and grits looked very promising. The coffee was delicious. I did have to send my grits back because they were cold, but they came back piping hot. I do say that I did prefer the potatoes my wife had more than the grits though. There was also an option to have fresh fruit as a side. I very much enjoyed this spot and will definitely be back."},{"business_id":"8eDkw7CE0NKqMknPIu26fw","review_id":"TVzeuIfsZnMvJvtpNQ_9Ew","date":"2015-10-13T04:54:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9374364614486694,"text_excerpt":"WOW incredible food. The bbq shrimp and grits here was probably my favorite thing that I ate in NOLA. A roommate had told me to get shrimp and grits before leaving NOLA and I'm glad I got to try it per his recommendation. The chia seed pudding was a nice breakfast option if you're feeling heavy from a weekend of nonstop eating: super fresh sweet blueberries topping off a generous portion of vanilla pudding and chia. Generous coffee refills and they boxed our things up quickly as we were in a rush and their kitchen was running behind. Despite that mini lag, I'm super glad we tried this place. Service was extremely hardworking but they could definitely use an extra hand. GREAT location next..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"8eDkw7CE0NKqMknPIu26fw","photo_id":"Kf-TkWrzHieY48aF_5N0KQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Kf-TkWrzHieY48aF_5N0KQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8697377443313599},{"business_id":"8eDkw7CE0NKqMknPIu26fw","photo_id":"nzdgrVq7hChqOYeteyySyg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/nzdgrVq7hChqOYeteyySyg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8651243448257446},{"business_id":"8eDkw7CE0NKqMknPIu26fw","photo_id":"Fxuc4Gk0k7389956K1RYfQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Fxuc4Gk0k7389956K1RYfQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.862040638923645},{"business_id":"8eDkw7CE0NKqMknPIu26fw","photo_id":"jvKs7_YklTCgu5VkdPZ90A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jvKs7_YklTCgu5VkdPZ90A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8395864963531494},{"business_id":"8eDkw7CE0NKqMknPIu26fw","photo_id":"Wkx8Kh__un9mGn9OAKgXag","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Wkx8Kh__un9mGn9OAKgXag.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8354068994522095}]},"notebook_case":null}
